],"h3",{"id":335},"label-and-description","Label and description",[312,338,339,342,343,346,347,351,352,356],{},[315,340,341],{},"label"," is the text next to the switch and ",[315,344,345],{},"description"," the text below it. It shows on one line and is truncated when wider than its container. A tooltip shows the full text on hover or focus, or on long press on touch devices (see ",[348,349,217],"a",{"href":350},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Ftooltip#touch-long-press","), the same as the ",[348,353,355],{"href":354},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fchoice\u002Fcheckbox#label","checkbox",". The description wraps: without one the height matches an input, and with one the switch grows while its first line still lines up with fields next to it.",[358,359],"component-example",{"name":360},"switch-basic",[333,362,363],{"id":321},"Action",[312,365,366,368],{},[315,367,321],{}," runs after toggling, receives the new value and may return a Promise. Use it for settings that are saved through an API as soon as they change, such as enabling an account or notifications.",[358,370],{"name":371},"switch-action",[373,374,375,398],"table",{},[376,377,378],"thead",{},[379,380,381,385,387,392],"tr",{},[382,383,384],"th",{},"Stage",[382,386,152],{},[382,388,389],{},[315,390,391],{},"v-model",[382,393,394,397],{},[315,395,396],{},"change"," event",[399,400,401,416,430,442],"tbody",{},[379,402,403,407,410,413],{},[404,405,406],"td",{},"Pending",[404,408,409],{},"Shows the new value, loading and disabled",[404,411,412],{},"Unchanged",[404,414,415],{},"Not emitted",[379,417,418,421,424,427],{},[404,419,420],{},"Success",[404,422,423],{},"Keeps the new value, loading and disabled end",[404,425,426],{},"Updated to the new value",[404,428,429],{},"Emitted",[379,431,432,435,438,440],{},[404,433,434],{},"Failure",[404,436,437],{},"Goes back to the old value, loading and disabled end",[404,439,412],{},[404,441,415],{},[379,443,444,447,450,452],{},[404,445,446],{},"Error",[404,448,449],{},"Same as failure",[404,451,412],{},[404,453,415],{},[455,456,457,474,491,499],"ul",{},[458,459,460,463,464,467,468,470,471,326],"li",{},[461,462,420],"strong",{},": only returning ",[315,465,466],{},"false"," (or a Promise resolving to ",[315,469,466],{},") counts as a failure. Any other value is a success, including no return value as in ",[315,472,473],{},"async () => { await save(value) }",[458,475,476,479,480,483,484,487,488,490],{},[461,477,478],{},"Errors",": when the action throws, the switch reverts the same way and the error is thrown again, for the global error handler or the console. To notify the user, ",[315,481,482],{},"try","\u002F",[315,485,486],{},"catch"," inside the action, show a message and return ",[315,489,466],{},", as in the example above.",[458,492,493,495,496,498],{},[461,494,406],{},": the switch is disabled, so the action is not called twice. If the page changes ",[315,497,391],{}," while pending, the page's value wins and is not overwritten when the action finishes.",[458,500,501,506,507,509,510,326],{},[461,502,503,504],{},"Without ",[315,505,321],{},", ",[315,508,391],{}," updates right after toggling, the same as ",[315,511,325],{},[312,513,514,515,518,519,522,523,326],{},"The ",[315,516,517],{},"SwitchAction"," and ",[315,520,521],{},"SwitchValue"," types can be imported from ",[315,524,525],{},"#shuo-ui\u002Fcomponents\u002FShuoSwitch.vue",[333,527,529],{"id":528},"on-and-off-values","On and off values",[312,531,532,518,535,538,539,518,542,544,545,483,548,551],{},[315,533,534],{},"true-value",[315,536,537],{},"false-value"," are the bound values when on and off, ",[315,540,541],{},"true",[315,543,466],{}," by default. Change them when the back end uses ",[315,546,547],{},"Y",[315,549,550],{},"N","; the action receives these values too.",[358,553],{"name":554},"switch-values",[333,556,558],{"id":557},"size-and-states","Size and states",[312,560,561,562,565,566,569,570,573,574,577,578,581,582,585,586,589,590,593,594,598],{},"When ",[315,563,564]